#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/content/contributor-feedback.bpmn:91
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "One row, one branch, one active pull request (owner, 2026-10-31): the agent edits on the row's branch and opens its pull request, or updates it when the row comes round again. A closed pull request the committee wants back is reopened, or replaced by a new one on the same branch; earlier ones stay listed in Agentic status. Agentic status (Green) says where it is, and Staging review opens the preview's what-changed page."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/content/contributor-feedback.bpmn:77
#. Diagram label
msgid "Propose a direction"
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/content/contributor-feedback.bpmn:78
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Reads: the row (Title, Selected Sections, the Contributor Feedback columns, Disposition) and the sections it names. Writes: a proposed direction in Feedback (agent) (Green), and the row's feedback basis on the Agent tab, so the script can tell when the feedback has moved on. A question for people goes in Feedback (agent) as a Decision needed block with options and a recommendation, and the row's Agentic status becomes Needs human; a chat card may repeat it, but the sheet is the record."
msgstr ""

